    {
      "text": "Manufacturer flyer titled '10-Color Multiplexing Technology: GeneXpert System Upgrade Options for HBDC Customers', with product photos above three numbered options: 1) convert current GeneXpert modules from 6-color to 10-color; 2) daisy-chain a 10-color satellite instrument to the current GeneXpert System; 3) order a new GeneXpert System with 10-color technology. Each option lists what must be ordered separately and computer requirements.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
